WEBVTT

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:02.791
Customer ne purana bill maanga, aur

00:00:02.791 --> 00:00:05.708
register mein mil nahi raha? Chaliye, shop

00:00:05.708 --> 00:00:07.815
ki billing aasaan banate hain.

00:00:08.155 --> 00:00:10.918
Excel ke billing form mein items add

00:00:10.918 --> 00:00:15.337
karein. Do notebooks, ek water bottle, aur ek coffee mug.

00:00:15.677 --> 00:00:19.187
Quantity daalte hi total aata hai. Is sale

00:00:19.187 --> 00:00:22.596
ka bill ₹1,050 hai. Save karte hi ye sales

00:00:22.596 --> 00:00:25.003
register mein jud jaata hai.

00:00:25.343 --> 00:00:28.075
Bill number se purana invoice search

00:00:28.075 --> 00:00:30.895
karein. Usi bill ka PDF nikaalein, aur

00:00:30.895 --> 00:00:33.716
customer ko share ya print karke dein.

00:00:34.056 --> 00:00:36.782
Shop se baahar hain? Agar online report

00:00:36.782 --> 00:00:39.592
set up karwayi hai, to phone par sales aur

00:00:39.592 --> 00:00:41.988
purane bills check kar sakte hain.

00:00:42.328 --> 00:00:45.323
Apni shop ke liye custom billing chahiye?

00:00:45.323 --> 00:00:48.146
Neeche contact karein. Apna aaj ka bill

00:00:48.146 --> 00:00:50.970
dikhayein, hum usi se shuruat karenge.
